@startuml CrossView_ContextView_Consistency

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam noteBorderColor gray
skinparam noteBackgroundColor lightyellow

' Define the views
component "Context View" as CV #Wheat
component "Functional View" as FV #LightGreen
component "Information View" as IV #LightPink
component "Deployment View" as DV #LightBlue
component "Development View" as DevV #LightGray

left to right direction

' Relationships
CV -- FV : "real-time interfaces align"
note on link
    Real-time multiplayer described in Functional View
    must match WebSocket endpoints and flows in the Context View.
end note

CV -- IV : "data boundaries consistent"
note on link
    Data flows across system boundaries (e.g., user profiles)
    must match entity definitions and flow models in the Information View.
end note

CV -- DV : "external elements must match"
note on link
    External components like PostgreSQL and Docker
    must also appear in the Deployment View’s physical structure.
end note

CV -- DevV : "interface tech aligned"
note on link
    Interface technologies (e.g., WebSockets)
    must be consistent with module responsibilities and structure in the Development View.
end note

' Summary Note
note bottom of CV
    <b>Context View Consistency</b>
    - Functional: Multiplayer ↔ WebSocket
    - Information: Profile data ↔ Entities
    - Deployment: PostgreSQL, Docker ↔ Nodes
    - Development: Interfaces ↔ Modules
end note

@enduml
